    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d63">

                <pb facs="0165" n="69" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg69"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Infante to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legacion de Chile</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-06-08"><hi rendition="#italic">June 8,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your favor of the 5th instant is at hand,
                    in which I am informed of your excellency’s desire to receive the amount which
                    has been agreed upon for the heirs of Patrick Shields.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to inform your excellency in reply that the proper law to make
                    this payment was not issued in the last period of sessions <pb facs="0166"
                        n="70" xml:id="pg70"/> of the Chilean congress, and that the minister of
                    foreign affairs in a communication which I have recently received informs me
                    that he will ask for the early issue of said law in the first regular meetings
                    of the congress. These meetings began on the first of the present month, and,
                    therefore, I hope that I shall soon receive authority by cable to make the
                    payment in question.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Infante.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
